   "PROTEIN_CLASS": "2.1.3.2",
   "metadata_previous_essentiality_curation": "URA2-only net reaction; its carbamoyl-phosphate intermediate is channelled and is not shared with arginine biosynthesis.",
   "metadata_reaction_selection": "metadata_reaction_fields_preserve_trna_20260910",
   "metadata_selected_fields": "gpr; stoichiometry",
   "metadata_selection_source_sha256": "33c14f0c524197ec732e09ba86c4382d5b21bc25b4bd73b18eba5f452dd7e797",
   "metadata_selection_evidence_status": "User-selected model version; not new validation of chemistry or native gene function",
   "selection_gpr_restore": "SELECTION-CPA-URA2-RESTORE-20261019",
   "selection_gpr_restore_evidence": "EG-GPR-001 (accepted legacy patch, dossier verdict needs_more_evidence): R159 is the net URA2 CPS + ATCase reaction with the carbamoyl-phosphate intermediate channelled, so it no longer draws on the m325 pool. YALI1E11768g = NCBI Gene 2912535 (XP_503737.3, 2186 aa), KEGG yli:2912535 K11541 carbamoyl-phosphate synthase / aspartate carbamoyltransferase; UniProt Q6C6H5 (unreviewed). ATCase is a URA2 domain; the CPA1 (YALI1D09420g) and CPA2 (YALI1C33005g) functions are carbamoyl-phosphate synthesis only, so they leave this GPR. Channelling of the URA2 product to its ATCase is experimental in S. cerevisiae (P07259); whether URA2 also feeds the arginine pool is unresolved for Yarrowia lipolytica (single pool in S. cerevisiae, separate pools in N. crassa and S. pombe). Identity by database annotation and homology; no Yarrowia lipolytica enzymology.",
   "selection_gpr_restore_evidence_status": "curated_annotation",
   "selection_gpr_restore_sources": "https://www.kegg.jp/entry/yli:2912535; https://rest.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/Q6C6H5; https://rest.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P07259; https://rest.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P07258; https://rest.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/P03965"
  }
 },
