   "selection_gpr_restore": "SELECTION-GPR-RESTORE-R671-20261019",
   "selection_gpr_restore_evidence": "YALI1F23441g = NCBI Gene 2909038 (XP_505545.1, 433 aa), KEGG yli:2909038 &apos;Prephenate dehydrogenase [NADP(+)]&apos;, K00211 (EC 1.3.1.13). The removed YALI1E11370g = NCBI Gene 2912526 (XP_503726.2), Swiss-Prot Q6C6I6 PET112, mitochondrial glutamyl-tRNA(Gln) amidotransferase subunit B (EC 6.3.5.7), KEGG K02434; it enters R671 through the isozyme-addition table, whose R671 row carries EC 6.3.5.7 (GatB&apos;s EC; the legacy model.xml annotates R671 with it, the source model does not), and the builder&apos;s remove_misannotated_gprs removes it before the selection re-adds it. Identity by database annotation and homology only; no Yarrowia lipolytica enzymology. The kept equation is mass-balanced; its +1 charge residual comes from the stored NADP+ charge of 0 and is not changed here.",
